  "id": "psychomotor",
  "term": "psychomotor",
  "definition": "In this context, psychomotor refers to approaches that work through the body and the senses, with attention to physical and sensory experience. It is used for therapies that aim to influence these experiences to support regulation, especially in stress and trauma.",
